---
import BaseLayout from '../../../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
const locale = 'sw';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Manunuzi na Wauzaji — Amri za Ununuzi, Upokeaji, Upatanisho wa Tatu"
  description="Usimamizi wa wauzaji, maombi ya ununuzi, amri za ununuzi, upokeaji wa bidhaa, upatanisho wa tatu, malipo ya wauzaji na manunuzi ya ushirika. Kraal Code ERP."
  locale={locale}
  canonicalUrl="https://kraalcode.com/sw/uwezo/ununuzi/"
>
  <section class="page-hero section--warm"><div class="container">
    <nav class="breadcrumb" aria-label="Njia ya mkate"><ol><li><a href="/sw/">Nyumbani</a></li><li><a href="/sw/uwezo/">Uwezo</a></li><li aria-current="page">Manunuzi na Wauzaji</li></ol></nav>
    <h1>Manunuzi na Wauzaji</h1>
    <p class="page-hero-subtext">Kutoka ombi la ununuzi hadi malipo ya muuzaji. Udhibiti, ufuatiliaji na upatanisho — katika kila hatua.</p>
  </div></section>

  <section class="section"><div class="container container--narrow">
    <h2>Kwa nani moduli hii</h2>
    <p>Maafisa wa manunuzi, wasimamizi wa ghala, timu za fedha na viongozi wanaohitaji kudhibiti matumizi ya ununuzi, kuthibitisha bidhaa zilizopokelewa na kuhakikisha malipo yanalingana na zilizoagizwa na kuletwa.</p>
  </div></section>

  <section class="section section--warm"><div class="container">
    <h2>Unachoweza kufanya</h2>
    <div class="feature-grid">
      <div class="feature-card"><h3>Usimamizi wa Wauzaji</h3><p>Faili la muuzaji na mawasiliano, masharti ya malipo, maelezo ya benki, usajili wa kodi na historia ya utendaji.</p></div>
      <div class="feature-card"><h3>Maombi ya Ununuzi</h3><p>Maombi kutoka idara yoyote. Mzunguko wa uidhinishaji kwa kiasi na kategoria. Geuza maombi yaliyoidhinishwa kuwa amri za ununuzi.</p></div>
      <div class="feature-card"><h3>Amri za Ununuzi</h3><p>Amri na mistari, idadi, bei zilizokubaliana na tarehe za utoaji. Fuatilia hali kutoka rasimu hadi imepokelewa kamili. Utoaji wa sehemu na marekebisho yanasaidiwa.</p></div>
      <div class="feature-card"><h3>Risiti za Bidhaa</h3><p>Rekodi za bidhaa zilizopokelewa dhidi ya amri za ununuzi. Kagua idadi na ubora. Tofauti zilizopewa alama kwa ukaguzi.</p></div>
      <div class="feature-card"><h3>Upatanisho wa Tatu</h3><p>Patanisha amri za ununuzi, risiti za bidhaa na ankara za wauzaji kabla ya malipo. Tofauti zinapewa alama kwa ukaguzi.</p></div>
      <div class="feature-card"><h3>Malipo ya Wauzaji</h3><p>Tengeneza vifurushi vya malipo. Hundi, uhamisho wa benki na mobile money. Fuatilia hali ya malipo. Uhasibu wa otomatiki.</p></div>
      <div class="feature-card"><h3>Manunuzi ya Ushirika</h3><p>Simamia miradi ya wakulima na vyama vya ushirika. Sajili wakulima, rekodi za upokeaji, matibabu ya mkopo na malipo.</p></div>
      <div class="feature-card"><h3>Ripoti za Manunuzi</h3><p>Uchambuzi wa manunuzi kwa muuzaji, kikundi na kipindi. Umri wa deni. Amri za ununuzi zilizofunguliwa. Utendaji wa wauzaji.</p></div>
    </div>
  </div></section>

  <section class="section--dark section"><div class="container text-center">
    <h2>Ona manunuzi kwa vitendo</h2><p>Oma onyesho lililobinafsishwa kwa mlolongo wako wa ugavi.</p>
    <a href="/sw/mawasiliano/" class="btn btn--inverse">Oma Onyesho →</a>
  </div></section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .page-hero{padding:var(--kc-space-20) 0 var(--kc-space-12)}.page-hero h1{font-size:var(--kc-text-4xl);max-width:700px}.page-hero-subtext{font-size:var(--kc-text-lg);color:var(--kc-text-secondary);max-width:60ch;margin-top:var(--kc-space-4)}.breadcrumb ol{list-style:none;padding:0;display:flex;gap:var(--kc-space-2);font-size:var(--kc-text-sm);color:var(--kc-text-tertiary);margin-bottom:var(--kc-space-6)}.breadcrumb a{color:var(--kc-teal);text-decoration:none}.breadcrumb li:not(:last-child)::after{content:'/';margin-left:var(--kc-space-2);color:var(--kc-text-tertiary)}.container--narrow{max-width:var(--kc-container-narrow)}.feature-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);gap:var(--kc-space-6);margin-top:var(--kc-space-8)}.feature-card{padding:var(--kc-space-6);background:var(--kc-surface-light);border:1px solid var(--kc-border-subtle);border-radius:var(--kc-radius-lg)}.feature-card h3{font-size:var(--kc-text-lg);font-family:var(--kc-font-body);font-weight:var(--kc-weight-semibold);margin-bottom:var(--kc-space-2)}.feature-card p{font-size:var(--kc-text-sm);color:var(--kc-text-secondary)}.btn--inverse{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;padding:var(--kc-space-4) var(--kc-space-8);font-weight:var(--kc-weight-semibold);font-size:var(--kc-text-base);border-radius:var(--kc-radius-lg);background:transparent;color:var(--kc-text-inverse);border:2px solid var(--kc-teal-light);transition:all var(--kc-transition-fast);text-decoration:none;margin-top:var(--kc-space-6)}.btn--inverse:hover{background:var(--kc-teal);border-color:var(--kc-teal)}@media(max-width:768px){.page-hero h1{font-size:var(--kc-text-3xl)}.feature-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}}
</style>
